  "options": [
   "(A) $32\\ \\mathrm{km}$",
   "(B) $16\\ \\mathrm{km}$",
   "(C) $64\\ \\mathrm{km}$",
   "(D) $640\\ \\mathrm{km}$",
   "(E) $3.2\\ \\mathrm{km}$"
  ],
  "correct": 0,
  "explanation_200": "To'g'ri: A. g≈g₀(1−2h/R), 2h/R=0.01 ⇒ h=R/200=32 km.\nAsos: (1+ε)^−2≈1−2ε.",
